    "https://urcareers.uregina.ca/postings/search?1245%5B%5D=2&commit=Search&sort=1246+asc&utf8=%E2%9C%93": {
      "title": "University of Regina Portal",
      "description": "University of Regina Portal | Search Jobs Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help FAQs If you need assistance, please contact Human Resources at UofR.Recruitment@uregina.ca. Search  Postings (4) More Search Options View all open Postings below, or enter search criteria to narrow your search. Keywords Posted Within Any time period Last Day Last Week Last Month Position Title Faculty/Department No Selection AVP (Academic) Office Centre for Continuing Education Child Trauma Research Centre (CTRC) Facilities Management Faculty of Arts Faculty of Education Faculty of Engineering and Applied Science Faculty of Graduate Studies & Research Faculty of Kinesiology and Health Studies Faculty of Media, Art, and Performance Faculty of Nursing Faculty of Science Faculty of Social Work Financial Services Hill Levene School of Business Human Resources Information Services Johnson Shoyama Graduate School La Cité Universitaire Francophone Library President's Office Provost Office Registrar's Office Student Affairs Student Affairs -Operations UR International University Advancement University Communications & Marketing University Secretariat VP Research Competition Number Category No Selection No Response Academic Executive Sessional Sessional Practica Coach Staff Student Casual Post Doctoral Fellowship (PDF) Other Employee Group No Selection CUPE 5791 CUPE 5791 - Research CUPE 2419 URFA URFA APT Out of Scope Other Post Doctoral Fellowship (PDF) Canada Research Chair (CRC) View Results (4\n    ) Posted Within - Any time period Category - Academic Competition Number Faculty/Department Category Job Close Date Employee Group ↑ Open-Rank Faculty Professor Position in Clinical Psychology 20240170A/S Faculty of Arts Academic URFA The University of Regina is a vibrant and growing campus in a province with a booming economy. The Department of Psychology comprises a large undergraduate and honours program in addition 